caption:
The second store of @arabicasg tucked inside shopping mall @313somerset and near Somerset MRT Station. Unique design with a white minimalist concept typical of @arabica.global, this place has a limited seating area and lots of bar-height tables around the aesthetic coffee bar. The touch of warm lighting and tropical vegetation creates calming and comfy ambience, perfect for relaxing while enjoying delicious specialty coffee. 
.
% ΔRΔBICΔ 
313 Orchard Rd, #01-14/15, Singapore 238895
@arabica.global #elfqinkopiarabica
@17508.id #elfqinkopisg #singapore

Had an afternoon coffee at another @arabicasg and this one's located inside IOI Central office building. Compact sized coffee shop near the lobby with a very limited stool chair seatings, the clean white minimalist concept creates calming and warm ambience, a perfect place to enjoy delicious coffee with your colleagues. 
.
% ΔRΔBICΔ 
IOI CENTRAL BOULEVARD TOWER, 2, Central Blvd, #02-02, Singapore
@arabica.global #elfqinkopiarabica
@17508.id #elfqinkopisg #singapore

We sent a taste of home to our friends overseas ✈️ Celebrating the familiar flavours that connect us, wherever we are. 🇸🇬❤️ 

