latestComments/2/text:
@oldchangkeesingapore curry puff is not just a snack. It is a national experience wrapped in flaky pastry and childhood memories. 👶🏻
The pastry is golden, buttery and flaky enough to leave evidence on your shirt — a true badge of honour. The potato filling 🥔 is so soft it could apply for a pillow licence, chicken chunks 🍗 with just enough curry kick to make you go “wah, shiok ah”. The curry 🥘 is fragrant, comforting and suspiciously addictive.
The Old Chang Kee curry puff doesn’t just feed your stomach — it feeds your Singaporean spirit. 🇸🇬
